# Captured PyTorch goldens -- deliberately NOT committed yet.
#
# 65 MB after compaction (461 MB raw; content-hash dedup plus fp16 for arrays
# above 1 M elements does the rest). Whether that belongs in the tt-metal tree is
# an open decision -- see 05/README.md D4. Three options were put forward:
#   (a) commit as-is;
#   (b) commit the 24 small modules (~42 MB) and regenerate the AR-decoder KV
#       cache golden (23 MB) on demand;
#   (c) shorten the golden utterance so T_prefill drops from 209 to ~50.
#
# Until that is settled, regenerate locally -- it takes ~40 s on CPU:
#
#   export PYTHONPATH=/mnt/CosyVoice:/mnt/CosyVoice/third_party/Matcha-TTS
#   /mnt/cosyvoice_env/bin/python ../../scripts/gen_golden.py --mode zero_shot
#
# Tests that need a golden skip cleanly when it is absent (see `needs_golden` in
# tests/pcc/test_istft.py), so an un-regenerated checkout still runs green.
*.npz
manifest.json
